  "notes": "Excalidraw with seeded planning board. Signature character: sketchy hand-drawn (rough.js) shapes and handwritten font on the canvas versus a crisp, quiet lavender-accented UI (#6965db selected tools, #e0dfff selected toggle fills). Floating panels with 8px radii and soft shadows over a white infinite canvas; tool buttons show single-letter shortcut hints in the corner. Content: flowchart (pastel-filled ellipse/diamonds/rects, labeled yes/no arrows, dashed retry loop), a cream sticky note of open questions, blue handwritten metrics annotation. Minimap toggle reveals a thumbnail overview of all frames (verified live); main menu holds command palette (Ctrl+/), find on canvas, theme and canvas background choices."
